          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalamubeelanga likhuwa elilachilisibwa obushia nobushia; mbu mumwesi kwomusaafu, khunyanga yekhumi eyomumwesi, mwisandinjie abeene, nimurakhola omulimo kwosi ta, kata abeebule kata omurende oumenyangakhwo mwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba khunyanga yino mulatisungwa, mbu musiiywe; mulasiiywa ebionoono bieenywe biosi imbeli wOMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisabato yomuhongo khwinywe; mwisandinjie abeene; nelikhuwa elilachilisibwa obushia nobushia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omukuhsni oulaba niyatsushiililwa amafura, oulaba niyaahulwa abe omukuhani mushilenje shiasamwana, akhole eshitiso niyeefwalile tsingubo tsana tsieikitani, nitsio tsingubo tsindakatifu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana atise habundu ahatakatifu, khandi atise liheema liokhwakaana, nende eshimalilo; khandi atise abakuhani, nabandu bosi belibukaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nako kalamubeelanga akalachilisibwa skarahwaho ta, mbu okhutisanga abaana baIsiraeli khulwa ebionoono biabwe biosi, lulala buli muyika. Kho Musa nakhola shinga OMWAMI olwa yamulaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
